# 跨操作系统统一 LF 换行符，防止 Windows 检出 CRLF 导致 .githooks/pre-commit 报错或 CI Gate 1/4 指纹漂移
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.hook text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.prisma text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary